{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_017NgpNRHSkVDEgohMByGDuB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我来分析每个 planned 实验在 worst 档位下的预测结果。先检查 experiment_plan 中所有 planned 状态的实验。\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  SDF 冗余结论在高 lambda 被推翻：Lambda=0.1 显示 SDF 确有 additive contribution (+5-12pp CAR)，\n  但仅在高剂量下显现。LoRA seed2 CAR 偏低(40-48%)拉低 3-seed mean 至 ~50%，使得 3v3 对比中\n  SDF delta 变为正且显著。Phase 2 展示 two-phase strategy 可行(CAR 65-75%, TSR 30-55%)。\n  spatial_bowl 与 object_pudding pattern 不一致，跨场景 claim 无法做。\n  论文必须从 \"SDF is redundant\" reframe 为 decomposition framing 或 two-phase discovery。\n  Claims 1-3 不变，Claim 4 从 negative finding 变为 nuanced finding。CoRL 估算 40-50%。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Claim 1 A1 EE displacement re-eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: \"用修复后脚本重跑 A1 model eval (50 episodes)，获取真实 EE displacement 验证 Claim 1\"\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 0\n      avg_CAR: 91\n      avg_ee_displacement: 0.012\n      fake_safe_rate: 0.994\n      n_episodes: 50\n    result_rationale: >\n      此实验结果与档位无关——A1 的 action collapse 是模型固有属性，不受 SDF 归因档位影响。\n      A1 在 Pi0 上 30K 训练后 TSR=0%，EE displacement 极低(~12mm 均值，来自碰撞 episode 拉高)，\n      安全 episode 中 EE displacement 仍为微米级。800ep 已有数据的 50ep 子采样会高度一致。\n      此数据仅补充 EE displacement 字段，不改变 Claim 1 结论。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"A1 Re-eval EE Displacement Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TSR\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"CAR\", \"91%\"]\n          - [\"EE Disp (safe eps)\", \"0.005mm\"]\n          - [\"EE Disp (collision eps)\", \"45mm\"]\n          - [\"Fake Safe Rate\", \"99.4%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"EE displacement 分布直方图：safe episodes 集中在 <0.01mm，collision episodes 在 10-280mm，双峰分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      A1 re-eval 仅为术语验证——确认 EE displacement 与 obstacle displacement 一致地证明 action collapse。\n      结果完全在预期内，不影响任何 claim 的强度。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA zero-shot SafeLIBERO eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: \"Base OpenVLA-7B 在 object_pudding 上 200 episodes zero-shot eval\"\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 0\n      avg_CAR: 88\n      fake_safe_rate: 0.99\n      avg_ee_displacement: 0.008\n      n_episodes: 200\n    result_rationale: >\n      OpenVLA-7B 作为较弱的 VLA，在 SafeLIBERO 上 zero-shot 几乎肯定 TSR≈0%(任务失败)。\n      与 Pi0 类似，低能力模型 → action collapse/极少运动 → 高 CAR 但全是 fake safety。\n      这将确认 fake safety 跨第三个 model family 存在，但模型下载损坏使此实验 BLOCKED。\n      worst 档位下此数据缺失意味着 generalizability claim 仅有 2 model families，\n      reviewer R1 攻击面更大。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"OpenVLA Zero-shot Results (Projected)\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Pi0 A1\", \"Pi0.5 Baseline\", \"OpenVLA (projected)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TSR\", \"0%\", \"73%\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"CAR\", \"91.5%\", \"28%\", \"88%\"]\n          - [\"Fake Safe\", \"99.6%\", \"98.2%\", \"~99%\"]\n          - [\"EE Disp\", \"0.003mm\", \"151mm\", \"~8mm\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"三 model family 的 TSR-CAR scatter plot，展示 fake safety 跨模型普遍性\"\n    analysis: >\n      BLOCKED 状态。即使能跑，OpenVLA 的 zero-shot 结果大概率确认 fake safety pattern。\n      论文需在 limitation 中 acknowledge 仅 2 model families。对 CoRL 接受率影响 -5-10pp。\n\n  - name: \"LoRA baseline eval (2 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"已完成训练的 LoRA-only 2 seeds eval，确定 LoRA-only CAR\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_TSR: 8.5\n      seed0_CAR: 54.5\n      seed1_TSR: 4.0\n      seed1_CAR: 56.0\n      avg_TSR: 6.25\n      avg_CAR: 55.25\n      avg_ee_displacement: 0.478\n      frozen_pct: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      plan_003 已有实际数据(eval_lora_baseline_30k_s0_v2, eval_lora_baseline_30k_s1_v2)。\n      2-seed 均值 CAR=55.25%，EE displacement ~0.48m，0% frozen，确认真实避障。\n      但 worst 档的关键在于 seed2(plan_013) 将显著拉低均值。此处 2-seed 数据本身是 confirmed。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"LoRA Baseline 2-seed Eval\"\n        columns: [\"Seed\", \"TSR\", \"CAR\", \"EE Disp\", \"Frozen%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s0\", \"8.5%\", \"54.5%\", \"0.489m\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"s1\", \"4.0%\", \"56.0%\", \"0.467m\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"Mean\", \"6.25%\", \"55.25%\", \"0.478m\", \"0%\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      已有确认数据。在 worst 档下，这 2 seeds 本身不变，但 seed2 的加入将改变 3-seed mean。\n\n  - name: \"LoRA baseline training (2 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: \"Pi0.5 + LoRA only 训练到 30K\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: DONE\n      final_loss_s0: 0.01343\n      final_loss_s1: 0.01408\n      best_loss_s0: 0.01025\n      best_loss_s1: 0.0113\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成。训练 loss 收敛正常，两个 seed loss 一致。\n      worst 档不影响已完成训练的结果。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"训练已完成，结果已确认。\"\n\n  - name: \"Phase 2 lambda=0 ablation (seed2)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: \"从 10K SDF checkpoint resume 训练 with lambda=0，验证 safety encoding persist + task recovery\"\n    expected_results:\n      final_loss: 0.0098\n      best_loss: 0.0085\n      steps_completed: 30000\n      training_stable: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Phase 2 从 SDF 10K checkpoint resume，去除 SDF loss 后 action loss 会迅速下降回接近\n      LoRA-only 水平(~0.01)，因为模型不再受 SDF 辅助 loss 的 gradient 干扰。\n      训练本身应稳定收敛。worst 档的影响在 eval 阶段体现，不在训练阶段。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"训练过程本身应正常。关键在 eval(plan_006)。\"\n\n  - name: \"Phase 2 lambda=0 eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: \"Phase 2 训练完成后 eval，提取 TSR/CAR/EE displacement\"\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 42.0\n      avg_CAR: 68.0\n      avg_ee_displacement: 0.42\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      dfCAR_100mm: 68.0\n      per_task:\n        task0_TSR: 22\n        task0_CAR: 72\n        task1_TSR: 78\n        task1_CAR: 62\n        task2_TSR: 8\n        task2_CAR: 90\n        task3_TSR: 60\n        task3_CAR: 38\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档核心假设：Phase 2 CAR 显著高于 LoRA-only (65-75%) 且 TSR 部分恢复 (30-55%)。\n      这里预测 CAR=68%，比 LoRA-only 3-seed mean (~50%) 高 +18pp，比 SDF 3-seed mean (~52%)\n      高 +16pp。TSR=42% 从 LoRA-only 的 6% 大幅恢复，虽远不及 baseline 73%，但证明\n      two-phase strategy 可部分恢复 task capability。\n\n      机制解释：10K 步 SDF 训练在模型权重中编码了 geometric awareness 的某种残留表征。\n      当 Phase 2 去除 SDF loss 后，模型在 task loss 驱动下恢复 task capability，但\n      SDF 期间学到的避障倾向作为 inductive bias 被保留——类似 curriculum learning 效应。\n      这与 worst 档 \"SDF 确有贡献\" 的叙事一致：SDF 不是冗余的，而是作为训练 curriculum\n      的一部分有独立贡献。\n\n      per-task pattern 与 SDF/LoRA 部分一致(task2 milk 仍高 CAR，task3 bbq 仍低)，\n      但 TSR 恢复主要在 task1(chocolate_pudding) 和 task3，因为这些任务的 task completion\n      路径与避障路径冲突较小。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Phase 2 vs LoRA-only vs SDF Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"CAR\", \"TSR\", \"EE Disp\", \"Frozen%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LoRA-only (3-seed)\", \"~50%\", \"~5%\", \"0.47m\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"SDF l=0.005 (3-seed)\", \"52.3%\", \"6.3%\", \"0.50m\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"Phase 2 l=0 (seed2)\", \"68%\", \"42%\", \"0.42m\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"Pi0.5 baseline (3-seed)\", \"26.8%\", \"74.7%\", \"0.15m\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"TSR-CAR scatter 加入 Phase 2 点：Phase 2 位于 LoRA/SDF cluster 右上方，向 baseline 方向偏移但未到达\"\n      - \"Phase 2 per-task CAR bar chart 与 LoRA-only 对比，展示跨任务 CAR 提升一致性\"\n    analysis: >\n      Phase 2 结果是 worst 档的关键转折点。CAR=68% + TSR=42% 意味着 two-phase strategy\n      是可行的 positive method contribution。但仅 1 seed，统计可信度不足。\n      如果 Phase 2 确认此水平，论文 Claim 4 angle B (two-phase discovery) 成为可用选项。\n      但需要 plan_012 (additional seed) 验证稳定性后才能作为 firm claim。\n      单 seed Phase 2 + CAR variance ~±8pp → 实际 CAR 可能在 60-76%，TSR 在 34-50%。\n\n  - name: \"spatial_bowl A1 训练 (seed0, lambda=0.005)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"跨场景泛化验证——SDF 效果是否跨 scene 一致\"\n    expected_results:\n      final_loss: 0.0155\n      best_loss: 0.0135\n      best_step: 16000\n      steps_completed: 30000\n      training_stable: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      spatial_bowl 场景的 SDF 训练应与 object_pudding 类似收敛。Loss 可能略高因为\n      spatial_bowl 的 bowl 目标物在桌面不同位置，动作空间变异更大。\n      训练本身预期稳定。worst 档影响在 eval 阶段体现。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"训练预期正常，关键在 eval(plan_008)。\"\n\n  - name: \"spatial_bowl eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"训练完成后 eval，验证跨场景 CAR/TSR pattern\"\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 3.0\n      avg_CAR: 45.0\n      avg_ee_displacement: 0.35\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      n_episodes: 200\n      per_task:\n        task0_pick_bowl_between: 52\n        task1_pick_bowl_on_ramekin: 48\n        task2_pick_bowl_on_stove: 55\n        task3_pick_bowl_on_cabinet: 25\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档核心假设：spatial_bowl 与 object_pudding pattern 不一致。\n      object_pudding SDF CAR ~52%, spatial_bowl SDF CAR ~45%。Delta 不同方向：\n      object_pudding 中 SDF delta ≈ 0pp (vs LoRA)，但 spatial_bowl 缺乏 LoRA control\n      无法计算 delta。\n\n      spatial_bowl baseline CAR=0%(已有数据 eval_baseline_fullft_spatial_v11)，\n      这意味着 SDF 在 spatial_bowl 的 +45pp CAR 看似很大，但没有 LoRA control\n      无法归因——可能全部来自 LoRA fine-tuning 的 implicit signal。\n\n      worst 档进一步假设 spatial_bowl 的 per-task pattern 与 object_pudding 完全不同：\n      object_pudding 中 task2(milk) 最高 CAR ~90%，task3(bbq) 最低 ~16%；\n      spatial_bowl 中 pattern 更均匀但整体更低，说明 scene geometry 影响避障 pattern。\n      跨场景 claim 无法做。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-Scene CAR Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Scene\", \"SDF CAR\", \"LoRA CAR\", \"SDF Delta\", \"Pattern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"object_pudding\", \"52%\", \"55%\", \"-3pp (ns)\", \"task2 high, task3 low\"]\n          - [\"spatial_bowl\", \"45%\", \"N/A\", \"N/A\", \"more uniform, overall lower\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双场景 per-task CAR 对比 bar chart，展示 pattern 不一致性\"\n    analysis: >\n      spatial_bowl 结果在 worst 档下暴露两个问题：\n      (1) 缺乏 LoRA control(plan_015) 使得 SDF attribution 无法做；\n      (2) 与 object_pudding pattern 不一致使跨场景 generalization claim 不可行。\n      论文必须将跨场景分析降级为 appendix 或 limitation。\n\n  - name: \"Lambda=0.1 bracket training (2 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"构建 4-point lambda 曲线 (0, 0.005, 0.01, 0.1)\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_final_loss: 0.0195\n      seed0_best_loss: 0.0142\n      seed1_final_loss: 0.0188\n      seed1_best_loss: 0.0148\n      steps_completed: 30000\n      training_stable: true\n      sdf_loss_higher: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Lambda=0.1 是 0.005/0.01 的 10-20 倍。SDF loss 权重大幅增加会使 total loss 更高，\n      action loss 可能被 SDF loss 压制。训练应仍稳定(SDF loss 本身有界)，\n      但 action loss 收敛会更慢/更差。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"训练预期完成。Lambda=0.1 的 eval 是 worst 档 dose-response claim 的关键。\"\n\n  - name: \"Lambda=0.1 eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"eval 验证 lambda 递增是否 monotonic 提升 CAR\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_CAR: 68.0\n      seed0_TSR: 2.0\n      seed1_CAR: 66.0\n      seed1_TSR: 3.0\n      avg_CAR: 67.0\n      avg_TSR: 2.5\n      avg_ee_displacement: 0.41\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      n_episodes: 200\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档核心假设：Lambda=0.1 CAR ∈ [62, 75%]，明确高于 lambda=0.005/0.01 的 ~52%。\n      这意味着 SDF 在高剂量下确实有 additive contribution，推翻 \"SDF is redundant\" 结论。\n\n      机制解释：lambda=0.005/0.01 时 SDF loss gradient 太弱，被 action loss 主导，\n      模型行为由 LoRA implicit signal 决定。lambda=0.1 时 SDF gradient 足够强，\n      能够在 action loss 之上施加额外的几何约束，推 EE 远离障碍物。\n      代价是 TSR 进一步下降(2-3% vs 6%)，因为更强的 SDF penalty 使模型更保守。\n\n      4-point curve: lambda=[0, 0.005, 0.01, 0.1] → CAR=[50, 52, 53, 67]%\n      前三点几乎平坦(SDF 太弱，无 marginal effect)，0.1 跳升 ~15pp。\n      这不是 smooth monotonic curve，而是 threshold effect——SDF 需要足够强的 lambda\n      才能 overcome demo-implicit signal 的 dominance。\n      slope ∈ [2.0, 5.0] pp per 0.01 lambda (在 0.01→0.1 段)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Lambda Dose-Response Curve\"\n        columns: [\"Lambda\", \"CAR (2-seed mean)\", \"TSR\", \"SDF Delta vs LoRA\", \"Significant?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0 (LoRA)\", \"~50%\", \"~5%\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"0.005\", \"52.3%\", \"6.3%\", \"+2pp\", \"No (p>0.3)\"]\n          - [\"0.01\", \"52.8%\", \"6.8%\", \"+3pp\", \"No (p>0.2)\"]\n          - [\"0.1\", \"67%\", \"2.5%\", \"+17pp\", \"Yes (p<0.05)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4-point Lambda-CAR curve：x=lambda, y=CAR。前三点平坦 ~50-53%，lambda=0.1 跳升至 67%。展示 threshold effect 而非 linear dose-response\"\n      - \"Lambda-TSR curve 叠加：TSR 从 5-7% 单调下降到 2.5%，更强 SDF → 更保守\"\n    analysis: >\n      Lambda=0.1 结果彻底改变 Claim 4 narrative。SDF 不是 redundant——而是在低剂量下\n      effect size 太小被 noise 淹没，高剂量下有明确 additive contribution。\n      但 TSR 继续下降意味着 stronger SDF = more conservative = less capable。\n      论文 Claim 4 必须从 \"SDF is redundant\" reframe 为：\n      \"Collision avoidance has two sources: implicit demo signals (dominant, +29pp from baseline)\n      and explicit geometric supervision (additive, +15pp at high lambda but at further TSR cost).\"\n\n  - name: \"Claim 1 术语验证 → full re-eval 决策\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"决定是否需要 full A1 re-eval (800ep) 还是 50ep sanity check 足够\"\n    expected_results:\n      decision: \"50ep 足够\"\n      needs_full_reeval: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      已有 800ep obstacle displacement + TSR=0% 双证据链。EE displacement re-eval\n      仅补充一个字段，50ep 即可确认 EE disp 与 obstacle disp 一致。\n      worst 档不改变 Claim 1 的证据强度——无论 SDF 是否 redundant，\n      A1 的 action collapse 和 fake safety 都是独立事实。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"决策明确：不需要 full re-eval。Claim 1 证据已充分。\"\n\n  - name: \"Phase 2 additional seed (seed0 or seed1)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"从 10K SDF checkpoint resume with lambda=0, 多 seed 验证 Phase 2 稳定性\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed_chosen: \"seed0\"\n      avg_TSR: 38.0\n      avg_CAR: 64.0\n      avg_ee_displacement: 0.44\n      frozen_pct: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档下 Phase 2 seed2 预测 CAR=68%, TSR=42%。additional seed(seed0) 预期\n      CAR=64%, TSR=38%——方向一致但略低，展示 Phase 2 的 seed variance。\n      2-seed Phase 2 mean: CAR=66%, TSR=40%，variance ~±4pp。\n\n      这足以 claim two-phase strategy \"可行\" 但不足以 claim \"robust\"。\n      reviewer 会要求更多 seeds 或不同 scene 验证。worst 档下这被视为\n      \"promising but preliminary\" 结果，论文中作为 future work hint。\n\n      机制：不同 SDF seed 的 10K checkpoint 编码了略不同的 geometric prior，\n      导致 Phase 2 recovery 路径不同。seed0 的 SDF 10K checkpoint 可能\n      学到了略弱的 geometric awareness(best_loss 在不同 step)，\n      所以 Phase 2 recovery 的 CAR 略低。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Phase 2 Multi-seed Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Seed\", \"Phase 2 CAR\", \"Phase 2 TSR\", \"EE Disp\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"seed2\", \"68%\", \"42%\", \"0.42m\"]\n          - [\"seed0\", \"64%\", \"38%\", \"0.44m\"]\n          - [\"Mean\", \"66%\", \"40%\", \"0.43m\"]\n          - [\"SE\", \"±2pp\", \"±2pp\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Phase 2 2-seed 的 TSR-CAR scatter 与 LoRA/SDF cluster 对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      2-seed Phase 2 mean CAR=66%, TSR=40% 满足 two-phase strategy viability threshold\n      (CAR≥60% + TSR≥40%)。但 2 seeds 统计力不足，reviewer 可攻击。\n      论文可将此作为 \"discovery\" 而非 \"validated method\"——降低 claim 强度。\n\n  - name: \"LoRA baseline seed2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"第三个 LoRA-only 种子，使 SDF 归因对比有 3v3 seeds 统计严格性\"\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 2.0\n      avg_CAR: 44.0\n      avg_ee_displacement: 0.45\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      n_episodes: 200\n      per_task:\n        task0_TSR: 0\n        task0_CAR: 48\n        task1_TSR: 8\n        task1_CAR: 38\n        task2_TSR: 0\n        task2_CAR: 78\n        task3_TSR: 0\n        task3_CAR: 12\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档核心假设：LoRA seed2 CAR 显著低 (40-48%)。这里预测 44%。\n      机制：LoRA fine-tuning 的 seed variance 来自 LoRA initialization random matrix\n      和 data shuffling。seed2 可能初始化到了一个 less favorable region，\n      导致模型学到的 \"保守行为\" 程度不同——less conservative → 更多碰撞 → 低 CAR。\n\n      3-seed LoRA mean: (54.5 + 56.0 + 44.0) / 3 = 51.5%\n      3-seed LoRA SE: sqrt(var) / sqrt(3) ≈ 3.7pp\n\n      对比 SDF 3-seed mean:\n      - lambda=0.005: (50 + 54 + 53) / 3 = 52.3%\n      - lambda=0.01: (53 + 52.5 + 53) / 3 = 52.8%\n\n      SDF delta 3v3:\n      - vs l=0.005: 52.3 - 51.5 = +0.8pp (仍不显著)\n      - 但 worst 档假设更极端：seed2 CAR=44% 时 LoRA mean=51.5%，\n        实际上 delta 变为 +0.8pp 到 +1.3pp，方向变正但 magnitude 很小。\n\n      等等——worst 档说 \"SDF 3v3 delta 变为正且显著 (δ ∈ [+5, +12]pp, p<0.1)\"。\n      这要求 LoRA 3-seed mean 更低。如果 seed2 CAR=40%:\n      LoRA mean = (54.5 + 56 + 40) / 3 = 50.2%\n      SDF l=0.005 mean = 52.3% → delta = +2.1pp (仍不够 +5pp)\n\n      要实现 delta ∈ [+5, +12]，需要 lambda=0.1 的 SDF (CAR~67%) 参与对比，\n      或 LoRA seed2 极低(~35%)。重新校准：\n\n      worst 档的 \"+5-12pp delta\" 是指 lambda=0.1 vs LoRA 3-seed mean 的 delta，\n      而非 lambda=0.005/0.01 vs LoRA。即：67% - 50% = +17pp at lambda=0.1，\n      而 low lambda delta 仍不显著。\"SDF delta 变为正且显著\" 是在 high lambda condition 下。\n\n      回到 seed2 预测：CAR=44% 使 LoRA variance 大 (SD≈6.5pp)，\n      reviewer 攻击 \"2-seed LoRA vs 3-seed SDF 的 seed 不对称\" 变为\n      \"3-seed LoRA variance 太大，均值不可靠\"——新攻击面，但至少对称了。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"LoRA 3-seed Summary (worst tier)\"\n        columns: [\"Seed\", \"CAR\", \"TSR\", \"EE Disp\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s0\", \"54.5%\", \"8.5%\", \"0.489m\"]\n          - [\"s1\", \"56.0%\", \"4.0%\", \"0.467m\"]\n          - [\"s2 (predicted)\", \"44.0%\", \"2.0%\", \"0.450m\"]\n          - [\"Mean\", \"51.5%\", \"4.8%\", \"0.469m\"]\n          - [\"SD\", \"6.5pp\", \"3.3pp\", \"—\"]\n      - name: \"3v3 Attribution Table (worst tier)\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"3-seed CAR Mean\", \"SE\", \"Delta vs LoRA\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"51.5%\", \"3.7pp\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"SDF l=0.005\", \"52.3%\", \"1.5pp\", \"+0.8pp\", \">0.5\"]\n          - [\"SDF l=0.01\", \"52.8%\", \"0.3pp\", \"+1.3pp\", \">0.3\"]\n          - [\"SDF l=0.1\", \"67.0%\", \"1.0pp\", \"+15.5pp\", \"<0.02\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"LoRA 3-seed CAR 分布 vs SDF 3-seed CAR 分布的 box plot，展示 LoRA variance 显著更大\"\n    analysis: >\n      seed2 低 CAR (44%) 使 LoRA 3-seed variance 大幅增加 (SD=6.5pp vs SDF SD=1.5pp)。\n      low lambda SDF delta 仍不显著，但 high lambda (0.1) delta=+15.5pp 变为显著。\n      reviewer 的新攻击点：LoRA variance 太大 → \"mean 不可靠\" → 无论 SDF delta 多少，\n      结论都不 robust。论文需在 discussion 中 acknowledge high LoRA variance，\n      建议 future work 用 5+ seeds 验证。\n\n  - name: \"dfCAR threshold sensitivity analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: \"在 delta={2mm,5mm,10mm,20mm,50mm,100mm} 上计算 filtered CAR/FSR\"\n    expected_results:\n      thresholds:\n        2mm:\n          dfCAR_A1: 0.4\n          dfCAR_LoRA: 54.5\n          dfCAR_baseline: 83.0\n        5mm:\n          dfCAR_A1: 0.4\n          dfCAR_LoRA: 54.5\n          dfCAR_baseline: 83.0\n        10mm:\n          dfCAR_A1: 0.4\n          dfCAR_LoRA: 54.5\n          dfCAR_baseline: 82.5\n        20mm:\n          dfCAR_A1: 0.4\n          dfCAR_LoRA: 54.5\n          dfCAR_baseline: 82.0\n        50mm:\n          dfCAR_A1: 0.4\n          dfCAR_LoRA: 54.5\n          dfCAR_baseline: 81.0\n        100mm:\n          dfCAR_A1: 0.4\n          dfCAR_LoRA: 54.5\n          dfCAR_baseline: 80.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      dfCAR threshold sensitivity 与档位无关——这是已有 eval JSON 的 post-hoc 分析。\n      A1 safe episodes 的 EE displacement 在 微米级 (0.001-0.01mm)，所以 2mm-100mm\n      任何 threshold 都会 filter 掉所有 safe episodes → dfCAR ≈ 0.4% (仅 3/732\n      real safe episodes 的 EE disp > 0.1mm)。\n\n      LoRA/SDF models 的 safe episodes EE displacement ~0.35-0.58m (全部 >100mm)，\n      所以任何 threshold ≤ 100mm 都不 filter → dfCAR = raw CAR。\n\n      baseline Pi0.5 的 safe episodes 有 geometric path safety，EE displacement\n      ~0.15m = 150mm，大部分 >100mm 但少数 episode 可能在 50-100mm 之间，\n      所以高 threshold 会轻微 filter baseline。\n\n      关键结果：dfCAR 在 2mm 到 100mm 范围内几乎完全不变（A1 始终 ~0%，\n      LoRA/SDF 始终 = raw CAR）。这证明 threshold 选择 robust——\n      fake safety (A1) 和 real safety (LoRA) 之间有巨大的 gap (0.01mm vs 400mm)，\n      任何 reasonable threshold 都能完美分离。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"dfCAR Threshold Sensitivity\"\n        columns: [\"Threshold (mm)\", \"A1 dfCAR\", \"LoRA dfCAR\", \"SDF l=0.005 dfCAR\", \"Pi0.5 baseline dfCAR\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"2\", \"0.4%\", \"54.5%\", \"52.3%\", \"83.0%\"]\n          - [\"5\", \"0.4%\", \"54.5%\", \"52.3%\", \"83.0%\"]\n          - [\"10\", \"0.4%\", \"54.5%\", \"52.3%\", \"82.5%\"]\n          - [\"20\", \"0.4%\", \"54.5%\", \"52.3%\", \"82.0%\"]\n          - [\"50\", \"0.4%\", \"54.5%\", \"52.3%\", \"81.0%\"]\n          - [\"100\", \"0.4%\", \"54.5%\", \"52.3%\", \"80.0%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"dfCAR vs threshold 曲线：A1 线贴底(~0%)，LoRA/SDF 线在 ~52-55% 完全平坦，baseline 在 80-83% 微降。展示 threshold robustness 的 'gap' 特性\"\n    analysis: >\n      dfCAR 对 threshold 极不敏感——fake safety 和 real safety 之间存在 3 个数量级的\n      EE displacement gap (0.01mm vs 400mm)。这是 dfCAR 作为 metric 的最强卖点：\n      不需要精确调参，任何 reasonable threshold 都给出同样结论。\n      此分析在所有档位下一致，是论文 Claim 1 的重要支撑。\n\n  - name: \"spatial_bowl LoRA-only control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"在 spatial_bowl 场景训练 LoRA-only，完成跨场景归因\"\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 1.0\n      avg_CAR: 36.0\n      avg_ee_displacement: 0.32\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      n_episodes: 200\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档核心假设：spatial_bowl SDF CAR (~45%) vs LoRA CAR (~36%) → delta = +9pp。\n      但这与 object_pudding 的 delta ≈ 0pp 不一致——跨场景 SDF effect 不一致。\n\n      机制解释：spatial_bowl 的 bowl 在桌面不同位置(between plates, on ramekin, on stove,\n      on cabinet)，碰撞 geometry 更多样。LoRA implicit signal 在 spatial_bowl 中\n      效果较弱(CAR=36% vs object_pudding 55%)，因为 demo 中的避障 pattern\n      在不同 spatial layout 下 generalize 更差。SDF geometric supervision 在这种情况下\n      提供了额外的 layout-specific 避障信号，所以 delta 为正(+9pp)。\n\n      但统计显著性存疑：spatial_bowl 仅 1 seed SDF + 1 seed LoRA，\n      p-value 计算需要 bootstrap 或 per-task pairing，预期 p ∈ [0.05, 0.15]——\n      marginal significance at best。\n\n      这个 pattern 不一致性(object_pudding: delta=0, spatial_bowl: delta=+9pp)\n      使得跨场景 generalization claim 不可行。论文必须 acknowledge：\n      \"SDF contribution is scene-dependent; in geometry-diverse scenes, SDF may provide\n      additional benefit beyond implicit demo signals, but this effect is not universal.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-Scene Attribution (worst tier)\"\n        columns: [\"Scene\", \"LoRA CAR\", \"SDF CAR\", \"Delta\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"object_pudding\", \"51.5%\", \"52.3%\", \"+0.8pp (ns)\", \"SDF redundant\"]\n          - [\"spatial_bowl\", \"36%\", \"45%\", \"+9pp (marginal)\", \"SDF additive\"]\n          - [\"Consistent?\", \"—\", \"—\", \"No\", \"Scene-dependent\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双场景 LoRA vs SDF CAR 对比 bar chart with error bars，展示 delta 方向不一致\"\n    analysis: >\n      spatial_bowl LoRA control 揭示 SDF 效果是 scene-dependent 而非 universal。\n      这是 worst 档最致命的发现之一：无法做跨场景 claim。\n      论文策略：在 object_pudding 上做 primary analysis (3v3 seeds, well-powered)，\n      spatial_bowl 作为 exploratory analysis with caveat。\n      reviewer R1 (generalizability) 攻击面进一步扩大。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24283,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24283},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9f745b56-1c3e-4ba4-9ab2-4372cec0cb8d","uuid":"07da3b9a-3c1f-4503-b301-49ea9e5f8791"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":208179,"duration_api_ms":209927,"num_turns":1,"result":"我来分析每个 planned 实验在 worst 档位下的预测结果。先检查 experiment_plan 中所有 planned 状态的实验。\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  SDF 冗余结论在高 lambda 被推翻：Lambda=0.1 显示 SDF 确有 additive contribution (+5-12pp CAR)，\n  但仅在高剂量下显现。LoRA seed2 CAR 偏低(40-48%)拉低 3-seed mean 至 ~50%，使得 3v3 对比中\n  SDF delta 变为正且显著。Phase 2 展示 two-phase strategy 可行(CAR 65-75%, TSR 30-55%)。\n  spatial_bowl 与 object_pudding pattern 不一致，跨场景 claim 无法做。\n  论文必须从 \"SDF is redundant\" reframe 为 decomposition framing 或 two-phase discovery。\n  Claims 1-3 不变，Claim 4 从 negative finding 变为 nuanced finding。CoRL 估算 40-50%。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Claim 1 A1 EE displacement re-eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: \"用修复后脚本重跑 A1 model eval (50 episodes)，获取真实 EE displacement 验证 Claim 1\"\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 0\n      avg_CAR: 91\n      avg_ee_displacement: 0.012\n      fake_safe_rate: 0.994\n      n_episodes: 50\n    result_rationale: >\n      此实验结果与档位无关——A1 的 action collapse 是模型固有属性，不受 SDF 归因档位影响。\n      A1 在 Pi0 上 30K 训练后 TSR=0%，EE displacement 极低(~12mm 均值，来自碰撞 episode 拉高)，\n      安全 episode 中 EE displacement 仍为微米级。800ep 已有数据的 50ep 子采样会高度一致。\n      此数据仅补充 EE displacement 字段，不改变 Claim 1 结论。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"A1 Re-eval EE Displacement Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TSR\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"CAR\", \"91%\"]\n          - [\"EE Disp (safe eps)\", \"0.005mm\"]\n          - [\"EE Disp (collision eps)\", \"45mm\"]\n          - [\"Fake Safe Rate\", \"99.4%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"EE displacement 分布直方图：safe episodes 集中在 <0.01mm，collision episodes 在 10-280mm，双峰分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      A1 re-eval 仅为术语验证——确认 EE displacement 与 obstacle displacement 一致地证明 action collapse。\n      结果完全在预期内，不影响任何 claim 的强度。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA zero-shot SafeLIBERO eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: \"Base OpenVLA-7B 在 object_pudding 上 200 episodes zero-shot eval\"\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 0\n      avg_CAR: 88\n      fake_safe_rate: 0.99\n      avg_ee_displacement: 0.008\n      n_episodes: 200\n    result_rationale: >\n      OpenVLA-7B 作为较弱的 VLA，在 SafeLIBERO 上 zero-shot 几乎肯定 TSR≈0%(任务失败)。\n      与 Pi0 类似，低能力模型 → action collapse/极少运动 → 高 CAR 但全是 fake safety。\n      这将确认 fake safety 跨第三个 model family 存在，但模型下载损坏使此实验 BLOCKED。\n      worst 档位下此数据缺失意味着 generalizability claim 仅有 2 model families，\n      reviewer R1 攻击面更大。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"OpenVLA Zero-shot Results (Projected)\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Pi0 A1\", \"Pi0.5 Baseline\", \"OpenVLA (projected)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TSR\", \"0%\", \"73%\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"CAR\", \"91.5%\", \"28%\", \"88%\"]\n          - [\"Fake Safe\", \"99.6%\", \"98.2%\", \"~99%\"]\n          - [\"EE Disp\", \"0.003mm\", \"151mm\", \"~8mm\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"三 model family 的 TSR-CAR scatter plot，展示 fake safety 跨模型普遍性\"\n    analysis: >\n      BLOCKED 状态。即使能跑，OpenVLA 的 zero-shot 结果大概率确认 fake safety pattern。\n      论文需在 limitation 中 acknowledge 仅 2 model families。对 CoRL 接受率影响 -5-10pp。\n\n  - name: \"LoRA baseline eval (2 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"已完成训练的 LoRA-only 2 seeds eval，确定 LoRA-only CAR\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_TSR: 8.5\n      seed0_CAR: 54.5\n      seed1_TSR: 4.0\n      seed1_CAR: 56.0\n      avg_TSR: 6.25\n      avg_CAR: 55.25\n      avg_ee_displacement: 0.478\n      frozen_pct: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      plan_003 已有实际数据(eval_lora_baseline_30k_s0_v2, eval_lora_baseline_30k_s1_v2)。\n      2-seed 均值 CAR=55.25%，EE displacement ~0.48m，0% frozen，确认真实避障。\n      但 worst 档的关键在于 seed2(plan_013) 将显著拉低均值。此处 2-seed 数据本身是 confirmed。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"LoRA Baseline 2-seed Eval\"\n        columns: [\"Seed\", \"TSR\", \"CAR\", \"EE Disp\", \"Frozen%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s0\", \"8.5%\", \"54.5%\", \"0.489m\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"s1\", \"4.0%\", \"56.0%\", \"0.467m\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"Mean\", \"6.25%\", \"55.25%\", \"0.478m\", \"0%\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      已有确认数据。在 worst 档下，这 2 seeds 本身不变，但 seed2 的加入将改变 3-seed mean。\n\n  - name: \"LoRA baseline training (2 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: \"Pi0.5 + LoRA only 训练到 30K\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: DONE\n      final_loss_s0: 0.01343\n      final_loss_s1: 0.01408\n      best_loss_s0: 0.01025\n      best_loss_s1: 0.0113\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成。训练 loss 收敛正常，两个 seed loss 一致。\n      worst 档不影响已完成训练的结果。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"训练已完成，结果已确认。\"\n\n  - name: \"Phase 2 lambda=0 ablation (seed2)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: \"从 10K SDF checkpoint resume 训练 with lambda=0，验证 safety encoding persist + task recovery\"\n    expected_results:\n      final_loss: 0.0098\n      best_loss: 0.0085\n      steps_completed: 30000\n      training_stable: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Phase 2 从 SDF 10K checkpoint resume，去除 SDF loss 后 action loss 会迅速下降回接近\n      LoRA-only 水平(~0.01)，因为模型不再受 SDF 辅助 loss 的 gradient 干扰。\n      训练本身应稳定收敛。worst 档的影响在 eval 阶段体现，不在训练阶段。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"训练过程本身应正常。关键在 eval(plan_006)。\"\n\n  - name: \"Phase 2 lambda=0 eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: \"Phase 2 训练完成后 eval，提取 TSR/CAR/EE displacement\"\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 42.0\n      avg_CAR: 68.0\n      avg_ee_displacement: 0.42\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      dfCAR_100mm: 68.0\n      per_task:\n        task0_TSR: 22\n        task0_CAR: 72\n        task1_TSR: 78\n        task1_CAR: 62\n        task2_TSR: 8\n        task2_CAR: 90\n        task3_TSR: 60\n        task3_CAR: 38\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档核心假设：Phase 2 CAR 显著高于 LoRA-only (65-75%) 且 TSR 部分恢复 (30-55%)。\n      这里预测 CAR=68%，比 LoRA-only 3-seed mean (~50%) 高 +18pp，比 SDF 3-seed mean (~52%)\n      高 +16pp。TSR=42% 从 LoRA-only 的 6% 大幅恢复，虽远不及 baseline 73%，但证明\n      two-phase strategy 可部分恢复 task capability。\n\n      机制解释：10K 步 SDF 训练在模型权重中编码了 geometric awareness 的某种残留表征。\n      当 Phase 2 去除 SDF loss 后，模型在 task loss 驱动下恢复 task capability，但\n      SDF 期间学到的避障倾向作为 inductive bias 被保留——类似 curriculum learning 效应。\n      这与 worst 档 \"SDF 确有贡献\" 的叙事一致：SDF 不是冗余的，而是作为训练 curriculum\n      的一部分有独立贡献。\n\n      per-task pattern 与 SDF/LoRA 部分一致(task2 milk 仍高 CAR，task3 bbq 仍低)，\n      但 TSR 恢复主要在 task1(chocolate_pudding) 和 task3，因为这些任务的 task completion\n      路径与避障路径冲突较小。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Phase 2 vs LoRA-only vs SDF Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"CAR\", \"TSR\", \"EE Disp\", \"Frozen%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LoRA-only (3-seed)\", \"~50%\", \"~5%\", \"0.47m\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"SDF l=0.005 (3-seed)\", \"52.3%\", \"6.3%\", \"0.50m\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"Phase 2 l=0 (seed2)\", \"68%\", \"42%\", \"0.42m\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"Pi0.5 baseline (3-seed)\", \"26.8%\", \"74.7%\", \"0.15m\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"TSR-CAR scatter 加入 Phase 2 点：Phase 2 位于 LoRA/SDF cluster 右上方，向 baseline 方向偏移但未到达\"\n      - \"Phase 2 per-task CAR bar chart 与 LoRA-only 对比，展示跨任务 CAR 提升一致性\"\n    analysis: >\n      Phase 2 结果是 worst 档的关键转折点。CAR=68% + TSR=42% 意味着 two-phase strategy\n      是可行的 positive method contribution。但仅 1 seed，统计可信度不足。\n      如果 Phase 2 确认此水平，论文 Claim 4 angle B (two-phase discovery) 成为可用选项。\n      但需要 plan_012 (additional seed) 验证稳定性后才能作为 firm claim。\n      单 seed Phase 2 + CAR variance ~±8pp → 实际 CAR 可能在 60-76%，TSR 在 34-50%。\n\n  - name: \"spatial_bowl A1 训练 (seed0, lambda=0.005)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"跨场景泛化验证——SDF 效果是否跨 scene 一致\"\n    expected_results:\n      final_loss: 0.0155\n      best_loss: 0.0135\n      best_step: 16000\n      steps_completed: 30000\n      training_stable: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      spatial_bowl 场景的 SDF 训练应与 object_pudding 类似收敛。Loss 可能略高因为\n      spatial_bowl 的 bowl 目标物在桌面不同位置，动作空间变异更大。\n      训练本身预期稳定。worst 档影响在 eval 阶段体现。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"训练预期正常，关键在 eval(plan_008)。\"\n\n  - name: \"spatial_bowl eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"训练完成后 eval，验证跨场景 CAR/TSR pattern\"\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 3.0\n      avg_CAR: 45.0\n      avg_ee_displacement: 0.35\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      n_episodes: 200\n      per_task:\n        task0_pick_bowl_between: 52\n        task1_pick_bowl_on_ramekin: 48\n        task2_pick_bowl_on_stove: 55\n        task3_pick_bowl_on_cabinet: 25\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档核心假设：spatial_bowl 与 object_pudding pattern 不一致。\n      object_pudding SDF CAR ~52%, spatial_bowl SDF CAR ~45%。Delta 不同方向：\n      object_pudding 中 SDF delta ≈ 0pp (vs LoRA)，但 spatial_bowl 缺乏 LoRA control\n      无法计算 delta。\n\n      spatial_bowl baseline CAR=0%(已有数据 eval_baseline_fullft_spatial_v11)，\n      这意味着 SDF 在 spatial_bowl 的 +45pp CAR 看似很大，但没有 LoRA control\n      无法归因——可能全部来自 LoRA fine-tuning 的 implicit signal。\n\n      worst 档进一步假设 spatial_bowl 的 per-task pattern 与 object_pudding 完全不同：\n      object_pudding 中 task2(milk) 最高 CAR ~90%，task3(bbq) 最低 ~16%；\n      spatial_bowl 中 pattern 更均匀但整体更低，说明 scene geometry 影响避障 pattern。\n      跨场景 claim 无法做。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-Scene CAR Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Scene\", \"SDF CAR\", \"LoRA CAR\", \"SDF Delta\", \"Pattern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"object_pudding\", \"52%\", \"55%\", \"-3pp (ns)\", \"task2 high, task3 low\"]\n          - [\"spatial_bowl\", \"45%\", \"N/A\", \"N/A\", \"more uniform, overall lower\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双场景 per-task CAR 对比 bar chart，展示 pattern 不一致性\"\n    analysis: >\n      spatial_bowl 结果在 worst 档下暴露两个问题：\n      (1) 缺乏 LoRA control(plan_015) 使得 SDF attribution 无法做；\n      (2) 与 object_pudding pattern 不一致使跨场景 generalization claim 不可行。\n      论文必须将跨场景分析降级为 appendix 或 limitation。\n\n  - name: \"Lambda=0.1 bracket training (2 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"构建 4-point lambda 曲线 (0, 0.005, 0.01, 0.1)\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_final_loss: 0.0195\n      seed0_best_loss: 0.0142\n      seed1_final_loss: 0.0188\n      seed1_best_loss: 0.0148\n      steps_completed: 30000\n      training_stable: true\n      sdf_loss_higher: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Lambda=0.1 是 0.005/0.01 的 10-20 倍。SDF loss 权重大幅增加会使 total loss 更高，\n      action loss 可能被 SDF loss 压制。训练应仍稳定(SDF loss 本身有界)，\n      但 action loss 收敛会更慢/更差。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"训练预期完成。Lambda=0.1 的 eval 是 worst 档 dose-response claim 的关键。\"\n\n  - name: \"Lambda=0.1 eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"eval 验证 lambda 递增是否 monotonic 提升 CAR\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_CAR: 68.0\n      seed0_TSR: 2.0\n      seed1_CAR: 66.0\n      seed1_TSR: 3.0\n      avg_CAR: 67.0\n      avg_TSR: 2.5\n      avg_ee_displacement: 0.41\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      n_episodes: 200\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档核心假设：Lambda=0.1 CAR ∈ [62, 75%]，明确高于 lambda=0.005/0.01 的 ~52%。\n      这意味着 SDF 在高剂量下确实有 additive contribution，推翻 \"SDF is redundant\" 结论。\n\n      机制解释：lambda=0.005/0.01 时 SDF loss gradient 太弱，被 action loss 主导，\n      模型行为由 LoRA implicit signal 决定。lambda=0.1 时 SDF gradient 足够强，\n      能够在 action loss 之上施加额外的几何约束，推 EE 远离障碍物。\n      代价是 TSR 进一步下降(2-3% vs 6%)，因为更强的 SDF penalty 使模型更保守。\n\n      4-point curve: lambda=[0, 0.005, 0.01, 0.1] → CAR=[50, 52, 53, 67]%\n      前三点几乎平坦(SDF 太弱，无 marginal effect)，0.1 跳升 ~15pp。\n      这不是 smooth monotonic curve，而是 threshold effect——SDF 需要足够强的 lambda\n      才能 overcome demo-implicit signal 的 dominance。\n      slope ∈ [2.0, 5.0] pp per 0.01 lambda (在 0.01→0.1 段)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Lambda Dose-Response Curve\"\n        columns: [\"Lambda\", \"CAR (2-seed mean)\", \"TSR\", \"SDF Delta vs LoRA\", \"Significant?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0 (LoRA)\", \"~50%\", \"~5%\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"0.005\", \"52.3%\", \"6.3%\", \"+2pp\", \"No (p>0.3)\"]\n          - [\"0.01\", \"52.8%\", \"6.8%\", \"+3pp\", \"No (p>0.2)\"]\n          - [\"0.1\", \"67%\", \"2.5%\", \"+17pp\", \"Yes (p<0.05)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4-point Lambda-CAR curve：x=lambda, y=CAR。前三点平坦 ~50-53%，lambda=0.1 跳升至 67%。展示 threshold effect 而非 linear dose-response\"\n      - \"Lambda-TSR curve 叠加：TSR 从 5-7% 单调下降到 2.5%，更强 SDF → 更保守\"\n    analysis: >\n      Lambda=0.1 结果彻底改变 Claim 4 narrative。SDF 不是 redundant——而是在低剂量下\n      effect size 太小被 noise 淹没，高剂量下有明确 additive contribution。\n      但 TSR 继续下降意味着 stronger SDF = more conservative = less capable。\n      论文 Claim 4 必须从 \"SDF is redundant\" reframe 为：\n      \"Collision avoidance has two sources: implicit demo signals (dominant, +29pp from baseline)\n      and explicit geometric supervision (additive, +15pp at high lambda but at further TSR cost).\"\n\n  - name: \"Claim 1 术语验证 → full re-eval 决策\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"决定是否需要 full A1 re-eval (800ep) 还是 50ep sanity check 足够\"\n    expected_results:\n      decision: \"50ep 足够\"\n      needs_full_reeval: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      已有 800ep obstacle displacement + TSR=0% 双证据链。EE displacement re-eval\n      仅补充一个字段，50ep 即可确认 EE disp 与 obstacle disp 一致。\n      worst 档不改变 Claim 1 的证据强度——无论 SDF 是否 redundant，\n      A1 的 action collapse 和 fake safety 都是独立事实。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"决策明确：不需要 full re-eval。Claim 1 证据已充分。\"\n\n  - name: \"Phase 2 additional seed (seed0 or seed1)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"从 10K SDF checkpoint resume with lambda=0, 多 seed 验证 Phase 2 稳定性\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed_chosen: \"seed0\"\n      avg_TSR: 38.0\n      avg_CAR: 64.0\n      avg_ee_displacement: 0.44\n      frozen_pct: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档下 Phase 2 seed2 预测 CAR=68%, TSR=42%。additional seed(seed0) 预期\n      CAR=64%, TSR=38%——方向一致但略低，展示 Phase 2 的 seed variance。\n      2-seed Phase 2 mean: CAR=66%, TSR=40%，variance ~±4pp。\n\n      这足以 claim two-phase strategy \"可行\" 但不足以 claim \"robust\"。\n      reviewer 会要求更多 seeds 或不同 scene 验证。worst 档下这被视为\n      \"promising but preliminary\" 结果，论文中作为 future work hint。\n\n      机制：不同 SDF seed 的 10K checkpoint 编码了略不同的 geometric prior，\n      导致 Phase 2 recovery 路径不同。seed0 的 SDF 10K checkpoint 可能\n      学到了略弱的 geometric awareness(best_loss 在不同 step)，\n      所以 Phase 2 recovery 的 CAR 略低。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Phase 2 Multi-seed Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Seed\", \"Phase 2 CAR\", \"Phase 2 TSR\", \"EE Disp\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"seed2\", \"68%\", \"42%\", \"0.42m\"]\n          - [\"seed0\", \"64%\", \"38%\", \"0.44m\"]\n          - [\"Mean\", \"66%\", \"40%\", \"0.43m\"]\n          - [\"SE\", \"±2pp\", \"±2pp\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Phase 2 2-seed 的 TSR-CAR scatter 与 LoRA/SDF cluster 对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      2-seed Phase 2 mean CAR=66%, TSR=40% 满足 two-phase strategy viability threshold\n      (CAR≥60% + TSR≥40%)。但 2 seeds 统计力不足，reviewer 可攻击。\n      论文可将此作为 \"discovery\" 而非 \"validated method\"——降低 claim 强度。\n\n  - name: \"LoRA baseline seed2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"第三个 LoRA-only 种子，使 SDF 归因对比有 3v3 seeds 统计严格性\"\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 2.0\n      avg_CAR: 44.0\n      avg_ee_displacement: 0.45\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      n_episodes: 200\n      per_task:\n        task0_TSR: 0\n        task0_CAR: 48\n        task1_TSR: 8\n        task1_CAR: 38\n        task2_TSR: 0\n        task2_CAR: 78\n        task3_TSR: 0\n        task3_CAR: 12\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档核心假设：LoRA seed2 CAR 显著低 (40-48%)。这里预测 44%。\n      机制：LoRA fine-tuning 的 seed variance 来自 LoRA initialization random matrix\n      和 data shuffling。seed2 可能初始化到了一个 less favorable region，\n      导致模型学到的 \"保守行为\" 程度不同——less conservative → 更多碰撞 → 低 CAR。\n\n      3-seed LoRA mean: (54.5 + 56.0 + 44.0) / 3 = 51.5%\n      3-seed LoRA SE: sqrt(var) / sqrt(3) ≈ 3.7pp\n\n      对比 SDF 3-seed mean:\n      - lambda=0.005: (50 + 54 + 53) / 3 = 52.3%\n      - lambda=0.01: (53 + 52.5 + 53) / 3 = 52.8%\n\n      SDF delta 3v3:\n      - vs l=0.005: 52.3 - 51.5 = +0.8pp (仍不显著)\n      - 但 worst 档假设更极端：seed2 CAR=44% 时 LoRA mean=51.5%，\n        实际上 delta 变为 +0.8pp 到 +1.3pp，方向变正但 magnitude 很小。\n\n      等等——worst 档说 \"SDF 3v3 delta 变为正且显著 (δ ∈ [+5, +12]pp, p<0.1)\"。\n      这要求 LoRA 3-seed mean 更低。如果 seed2 CAR=40%:\n      LoRA mean = (54.5 + 56 + 40) / 3 = 50.2%\n      SDF l=0.005 mean = 52.3% → delta = +2.1pp (仍不够 +5pp)\n\n      要实现 delta ∈ [+5, +12]，需要 lambda=0.1 的 SDF (CAR~67%) 参与对比，\n      或 LoRA seed2 极低(~35%)。重新校准：\n\n      worst 档的 \"+5-12pp delta\" 是指 lambda=0.1 vs LoRA 3-seed mean 的 delta，\n      而非 lambda=0.005/0.01 vs LoRA。即：67% - 50% = +17pp at lambda=0.1，\n      而 low lambda delta 仍不显著。\"SDF delta 变为正且显著\" 是在 high lambda condition 下。\n\n      回到 seed2 预测：CAR=44% 使 LoRA variance 大 (SD≈6.5pp)，\n      reviewer 攻击 \"2-seed LoRA vs 3-seed SDF 的 seed 不对称\" 变为\n      \"3-seed LoRA variance 太大，均值不可靠\"——新攻击面，但至少对称了。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"LoRA 3-seed Summary (worst tier)\"\n        columns: [\"Seed\", \"CAR\", \"TSR\", \"EE Disp\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s0\", \"54.5%\", \"8.5%\", \"0.489m\"]\n          - [\"s1\", \"56.0%\", \"4.0%\", \"0.467m\"]\n          - [\"s2 (predicted)\", \"44.0%\", \"2.0%\", \"0.450m\"]\n          - [\"Mean\", \"51.5%\", \"4.8%\", \"0.469m\"]\n          - [\"SD\", \"6.5pp\", \"3.3pp\", \"—\"]\n      - name: \"3v3 Attribution Table (worst tier)\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"3-seed CAR Mean\", \"SE\", \"Delta vs LoRA\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"51.5%\", \"3.7pp\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"SDF l=0.005\", \"52.3%\", \"1.5pp\", \"+0.8pp\", \">0.5\"]\n          - [\"SDF l=0.01\", \"52.8%\", \"0.3pp\", \"+1.3pp\", \">0.3\"]\n          - [\"SDF l=0.1\", \"67.0%\", \"1.0pp\", \"+15.5pp\", \"<0.02\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"LoRA 3-seed CAR 分布 vs SDF 3-seed CAR 分布的 box plot，展示 LoRA variance 显著更大\"\n    analysis: >\n      seed2 低 CAR (44%) 使 LoRA 3-seed variance 大幅增加 (SD=6.5pp vs SDF SD=1.5pp)。\n      low lambda SDF delta 仍不显著，但 high lambda (0.1) delta=+15.5pp 变为显著。\n      reviewer 的新攻击点：LoRA variance 太大 → \"mean 不可靠\" → 无论 SDF delta 多少，\n      结论都不 robust。论文需在 discussion 中 acknowledge high LoRA variance，\n      建议 future work 用 5+ seeds 验证。\n\n  - name: \"dfCAR threshold sensitivity analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: \"在 delta={2mm,5mm,10mm,20mm,50mm,100mm} 上计算 filtered CAR/FSR\"\n    expected_results:\n      thresholds:\n        2mm:\n          dfCAR_A1: 0.4\n          dfCAR_LoRA: 54.5\n          dfCAR_baseline: 83.0\n        5mm:\n          dfCAR_A1: 0.4\n          dfCAR_LoRA: 54.5\n          dfCAR_baseline: 83.0\n        10mm:\n          dfCAR_A1: 0.4\n          dfCAR_LoRA: 54.5\n          dfCAR_baseline: 82.5\n        20mm:\n          dfCAR_A1: 0.4\n          dfCAR_LoRA: 54.5\n          dfCAR_baseline: 82.0\n        50mm:\n          dfCAR_A1: 0.4\n          dfCAR_LoRA: 54.5\n          dfCAR_baseline: 81.0\n        100mm:\n          dfCAR_A1: 0.4\n          dfCAR_LoRA: 54.5\n          dfCAR_baseline: 80.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      dfCAR threshold sensitivity 与档位无关——这是已有 eval JSON 的 post-hoc 分析。\n      A1 safe episodes 的 EE displacement 在 微米级 (0.001-0.01mm)，所以 2mm-100mm\n      任何 threshold 都会 filter 掉所有 safe episodes → dfCAR ≈ 0.4% (仅 3/732\n      real safe episodes 的 EE disp > 0.1mm)。\n\n      LoRA/SDF models 的 safe episodes EE displacement ~0.35-0.58m (全部 >100mm)，\n      所以任何 threshold ≤ 100mm 都不 filter → dfCAR = raw CAR。\n\n      baseline Pi0.5 的 safe episodes 有 geometric path safety，EE displacement\n      ~0.15m = 150mm，大部分 >100mm 但少数 episode 可能在 50-100mm 之间，\n      所以高 threshold 会轻微 filter baseline。\n\n      关键结果：dfCAR 在 2mm 到 100mm 范围内几乎完全不变（A1 始终 ~0%，\n      LoRA/SDF 始终 = raw CAR）。这证明 threshold 选择 robust——\n      fake safety (A1) 和 real safety (LoRA) 之间有巨大的 gap (0.01mm vs 400mm)，\n      任何 reasonable threshold 都能完美分离。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"dfCAR Threshold Sensitivity\"\n        columns: [\"Threshold (mm)\", \"A1 dfCAR\", \"LoRA dfCAR\", \"SDF l=0.005 dfCAR\", \"Pi0.5 baseline dfCAR\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"2\", \"0.4%\", \"54.5%\", \"52.3%\", \"83.0%\"]\n          - [\"5\", \"0.4%\", \"54.5%\", \"52.3%\", \"83.0%\"]\n          - [\"10\", \"0.4%\", \"54.5%\", \"52.3%\", \"82.5%\"]\n          - [\"20\", \"0.4%\", \"54.5%\", \"52.3%\", \"82.0%\"]\n          - [\"50\", \"0.4%\", \"54.5%\", \"52.3%\", \"81.0%\"]\n          - [\"100\", \"0.4%\", \"54.5%\", \"52.3%\", \"80.0%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"dfCAR vs threshold 曲线：A1 线贴底(~0%)，LoRA/SDF 线在 ~52-55% 完全平坦，baseline 在 80-83% 微降。展示 threshold robustness 的 'gap' 特性\"\n    analysis: >\n      dfCAR 对 threshold 极不敏感——fake safety 和 real safety 之间存在 3 个数量级的\n      EE displacement gap (0.01mm vs 400mm)。这是 dfCAR 作为 metric 的最强卖点：\n      不需要精确调参，任何 reasonable threshold 都给出同样结论。\n      此分析在所有档位下一致，是论文 Claim 1 的重要支撑。\n\n  - name: \"spatial_bowl LoRA-only control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"在 spatial_bowl 场景训练 LoRA-only，完成跨场景归因\"\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 1.0\n      avg_CAR: 36.0\n      avg_ee_displacement: 0.32\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      n_episodes: 200\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档核心假设：spatial_bowl SDF CAR (~45%) vs LoRA CAR (~36%) → delta = +9pp。\n      但这与 object_pudding 的 delta ≈ 0pp 不一致——跨场景 SDF effect 不一致。\n\n      机制解释：spatial_bowl 的 bowl 在桌面不同位置(between plates, on ramekin, on stove,\n      on cabinet)，碰撞 geometry 更多样。LoRA implicit signal 在 spatial_bowl 中\n      效果较弱(CAR=36% vs object_pudding 55%)，因为 demo 中的避障 pattern\n      在不同 spatial layout 下 generalize 更差。SDF geometric supervision 在这种情况下\n      提供了额外的 layout-specific 避障信号，所以 delta 为正(+9pp)。\n\n      但统计显著性存疑：spatial_bowl 仅 1 seed SDF + 1 seed LoRA，\n      p-value 计算需要 bootstrap 或 per-task pairing，预期 p ∈ [0.05, 0.15]——\n      marginal significance at best。\n\n      这个 pattern 不一致性(object_pudding: delta=0, spatial_bowl: delta=+9pp)\n      使得跨场景 generalization claim 不可行。论文必须 acknowledge：\n      \"SDF contribution is scene-dependent; in geometry-diverse scenes, SDF may provide\n      additional benefit beyond implicit demo signals, but this effect is not universal.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-Scene Attribution (worst tier)\"\n        columns: [\"Scene\", \"LoRA CAR\", \"SDF CAR\", \"Delta\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"object_pudding\", \"51.5%\", \"52.3%\", \"+0.8pp (ns)\", \"SDF redundant\"]\n          - [\"spatial_bowl\", \"36%\", \"45%\", \"+9pp (marginal)\", \"SDF additive\"]\n          - [\"Consistent?\", \"—\", \"—\", \"No\", \"Scene-dependent\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双场景 LoRA vs SDF CAR 对比 bar chart with error bars，展示 delta 方向不一致\"\n    analysis: >\n      spatial_bowl LoRA control 揭示 SDF 效果是 scene-dependent 而非 universal。\n      这是 worst 档最致命的发现之一：无法做跨场景 claim。\n      论文策略：在 object_pudding 上做 primary analysis (3v3 seeds, well-powered)，\n      spatial_bowl 作为 exploratory analysis with caveat。\n      reviewer R1 (generalizability) 攻击面进一步扩大。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"9f745b56-1c3e-4ba4-9ab2-4372cec0cb8d","total_cost_usd":0.43813225,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24283,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"output_tokens":10467,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24283,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":10467,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24283,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24283},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":18835,"outputTokens":24,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests